Mirobody genotype site catalog — public sample, dbSNP build 157

Provider: National Center for Biotechnology Information (NCBI), NLM/NIH.
Source: https://ftp.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/snp/archive/b157/JSON/refsnp-sample.json.bz2
Source SHA-256: ed2171d591f12c996107417fc42e2c3d61467814d0f5866af09baef2e1bfbd61
Marker input: benchmarks/genomics/fixtures/markers.tsv, extracted from the
  same public RefSNP JSON example, SHA-256
  1c407585428de558d94b19dbd37a4441783d3081186e3ad1ccfe0b92655f47c7.
Build: python3 benchmarks/genomics/build_site_catalog.py --manifest
  benchmarks/genomics/sample-b157.json --output
  mirobody/res/genomics/genotype_sites.sqlite3
Asset SHA-256: 1bd296bcbcf7b4f855b8c3f3673ade3af8c38f7223285f509bf1842994cd58de
Asset version: dbsnp-b157-sample; 1 site, 3 merged old rsIDs, 36,864 bytes.

NCBI describes dbSNP b157 as open-access public data:
https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2025/03/18/dbsnp-release-157/
NCBI's reuse policy for unrestricted molecular databases:
https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/home/about/policies/
This catalog is a derived, one-site parser example. It does not contain a
consumer-array union and does not meet the 1.5.2 G0 acceptance gate. It
contains no personal genotype or health record.
